per window and label whose logit exceeds the threshold chosen when the
file was written. Three headers are recognised:\tabular{ll}{
   Header \tab Writer \cr
   \verb{idx,project,filename,window_start,window_end,label,logits} \tab perch-hoplite, from December 2025 \cr
   \verb{idx,dataset_name,source_id,offset,label,logits} \tab perch-hoplite, 2025 \cr
   \verb{filename, timestamp_s, label, logit} \tab perch (chirp) \cr
}


The file of the audio (\code{filename} or \code{source_id}) is relative to the
folder the embeddings were computed from: give that folder in
